WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
Modernization makes broader
AI participation practical.

00:00:03.533 --> 00:00:07.120
Begin with trusted requirements
and reviewed expectations.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:11.600
Build reliable tests, resettable
data and controlled dependencies.

00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:16.920
Turn those capabilities into supported
services that another squad can reuse.

00:00:17.024 --> 00:00:21.600
Only then expand execution authority
where the evidence supports it.

00:00:21.742 --> 00:00:25.280
Reviewed assistance can start
while foundations improve.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.960
The roadmap is about
earning reliable capability,

00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:32.400
rather than waiting for every application
to reach an identical maturity level.
